(Motivational coaching is crucial: trainers who build intrinsic motivation — emphasising competence,) Tj
T* (autonomy and appropriate challenge — see higher client adherence and effort during sessions \(Silva et) Tj
T* (al., 2025; Hill et al., 2021\). Addressing barriers like pricing and professional development through facility) Tj
T* (support such as trainer-client matching and ongoing education further sustains retention \(Özgen et al.,) Tj
T* (2025\). Evidence also highlights the role of word-of-mouth, reasonable pricing and responsive service in) Tj
T* (maintaining satisfaction, leading to repeat business and referrals \(Nursanti & Tomoliyus, 2021\).) Tj
